# jj undo

> Undo the most recent recorded operation in a `jj` repository.
> See also: `jj operation log`, `jj operation restore`.
> More information: <https://docs.jj-vcs.dev/latest/cli-reference/#jj-undo>.

- Undo the last operation:

`jj undo`
